    "message": "Give each live source search run its own usage account\n\nThe official-domain search check reserved on one fixed account,\nlive-source-search-stream-qa (#152). Every run sends the same request\nwith a fresh tape, and an account refuses a request key it already\nholds a receipt for (usage_receipt_exists), so only the first run on a\nmachine could pass; the receipts would also make its 2-call cap cover\nevery run. Each run now opens live-source-search-stream-qa-<random>\nwith the same caps, as the model check does since #148. The setup moves\ninto the live_source_search_check fixture, and\ntests/unit/llm/test_accounting.py runs it three times in one store with\na fake web-search provider; with the fixed account the second run is\nrefused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
